# Enterprise Multi-Document Q&A System (RAG)

An enterprise document question-answering system that allows authenticated users to upload documents, process their contents, and ask natural-language questions using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).

## Features

* User registration and login
* JWT-based authentication
* Password hashing with bcrypt
* Secure user-specific document access
* Document upload support
* Text extraction from uploaded documents
* Document chunking
* Gemini-based document embeddings
* Vector similarity search
* Gemini-based answer generation
* Source-aware answers
* Multi-document question answering
* Conversation management
* Document processing status tracking
* Document deletion
* Modern responsive web interface

## Technology Stack

### Backend

* Python
* FastAPI
* SQLAlchemy
* PostgreSQL
* Pydantic
* JWT
* Passlib / bcrypt
* python-multipart
* pypdf
* python-docx
* Google GenAI SDK

### Frontend

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

### AI / RAG

* Gemini for text generation
* Gemini embeddings
* Vector similarity search
* Retrieval-Augmented Generation

